OLED SSD1306 Engineering Fault Clinic:
Case 1: SPI Clock Speed Comparison
- 1 MHz:  Render time = 8.2 ms (Slight visible tearing during fast rotation)
- 10 MHz: Render time = 0.8 ms (Smooth 60 FPS, no tearing)
